    {"op": "Wait", "line": 25, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 27, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "昨晚，我确实在地下按了按钮。<br>\n只是单纯地……按下了按钮。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然大家都不相信……<br>\n可我真的，没想过要杀死亚里沙……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 31, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "估计当时亚里沙在审判庭里<br>\n喝下了梅露露给她的安眠药。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 33, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她……打算自杀。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 35, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S01", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 37, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S02", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "说不定她是想起了那些<br>\n在审判庭受刑的人。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可是，就在亚里沙把安眠药喝光后，<br>\n她发现了一个问题。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "安眠药的药瓶上，写着梅露露的名字。<br>\n……如果不处理一下的话，其他人就会怀疑梅露露是凶手。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema007"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S02", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S03", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "为了让梅露露免遭怀疑，<br>\n亚里沙才会在慌忙之间使用魔法，<br>\n打算把标签给烧掉。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过药瓶也因此炸裂了。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在冲击的作用下，亚里沙的脸上留下了一道烫伤痕……<br>\n接着，亚里沙就失去了意识。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema010"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 71, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S03", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S04", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "之后，我在毫不知情的情况下在地下设施按下了按钮……<br>\n亚里沙也因此随着处刑台转移到了地下。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "于是亚里沙在熟睡的状态下，在地下冻成冰块……<br>\n活活冻死了。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 83, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这一切……都是意外。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema013"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 86, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S04", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E04_S02", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 92, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "随着时间流逝，<br>\n亚里沙冻僵的尸体解冻了，<br>\n把她的头发和衣服都弄湿了。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 96, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙之所以会自杀，<br>\n恐怕是因为她的魔女化程度变得很深……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她想阻止自己向我们出手……<br>\n她想保护我们。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 100, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以……这不是我的错……<br>\n我没有做坏事……我没有……为什么……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0104Trial12_Ema017"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 102, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
